      "divergence": {
        "note": "The shipped code (sherpa-data-grid.ts) is a plain <table> — head row + body rows, sortable, no pinning/selection/per-column filters. This def + the Figma build capture the RICHER designed architecture (flat pinned columns). Reconcile later: either enrich the code to the column model, or scope the Figma component to match. Public API (data-sort-field/direction, grid-sort-change, row-click) is preserved on both sides."
